OL,3,AThree sisters who drowned in sea off
OL,4,ABrighton took own lives, inquest finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree sisters who drowned in the sea
OL,7,Foff Brighton took their own lives, a
OL,8,Fcoroner has ruled.
OL,10,FJane Adetoro, 36, Christina Walters,
OL,11,F32, and Rebecca Walters, 31, who had
OL,12,Fall been living together in Greenford,
OL,13,FLondon, died on 13 May.
OL,15,FOn 11 May, the sisters had visited an
OL,16,Farea of Birmingham close to where their
OL,17,Fmother had drowned in 2010. They then
OL,18,Ftravelled to Brighton.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
